       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like an error.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day for adults. The single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. At this dose the risks include GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and cardiovascular events.\n\nWhich of these did you mean?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), which is a common regimen for inflammatory conditions\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd also suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
